<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Hyundai Heavy wins $57 mln Chinese order.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Hyundai Heavy wins $57 mln Chinese order.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hyundai Heavy Industries Co Ltd, a unit of South Korea's Hyundai Group, said on Monday it had won a $57 million order from China to build an offshore oil exploration platform.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the platform would be built on a turn-key basis and delivered to China National Offshore Oil Corp in October, 1998.</p>
<p>The oil exploration structure, to be assembled in Zhanjiang with the use of local workforce and facilities, would be used to develop an oil field in the southern Chinese region of Weizhou.</p>
</text>
